    "enUS": {
      "description": "This hearty stew keeps our trainees fed, enough so that our enemies remain at a distance.\r\n\r\nBring this and feed our trainees to the west. Don't listen to any complaints. With how difficult defending our supply lines has become, they should be so lucky we're not feeding them dirt.",
      "dialogue": {
        "da40b5f40e0558b8fbdd": "Any more complaints and they can bring them to me directly.\n\nI am thankful for your work in retrieving this food, as are our warriors, despite what they say."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Rog'mar Trainee fed",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Feed 8 Rog'mar Trainees at the training grounds.",
      "title": "A Serving of Strength",
